 kit delivery - lists the forge's releases, builds, artifacts, environments, and deployments

   one of
   *kit delivery*  lists the forge's releases, builds, artifacts, environments, and deployments

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages      prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks       prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object, which changes when what the stage
                 draws does: the forge's own mark of its runs, as a run makes each; environments'
                 and deployments' also hold the forge's mark of their own kind, as another tool may
                 deploy and a person may edit one
   artifacts     the artifacts the runs kept, the newest 100 at most
   environments  the deployment environments, each with what guards it
   deployments   the deployments, the newest 50 at most
   releases      the releases on the forge, as kit flow releases prints them; on a terminal it opens
                 in kittui
   builds        the runs no change owns, as kit flow builds prints them; on a terminal it opens in
                 kittui


 kit delivery
